# cost under GPU and x86 models, plus custom models and errors.
f(x: u32) = x*x + 1
div(a: u32, b: u32) = a / b
cost f
cost f model gt1030
cost f model sm75
cost f model rdna2
cost f model zen4
cost f model skl
cost f model x86v4
cost f model nosuch
cost div model gt1030
cost div model zen4
model mine : gt1030 { imul: 1, idiv: 4 }
cost f model mine
use nosuch
use zen4
cost f
